    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/87086e7273e3655fa6fc35d90b82cbe5.poster.avif?t=1754628660\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/87086e7273e3655fa6fc35d90b82cbe5.webm?t=1754628660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/87086e7273e3655fa6fc35d90b82cbe5.mp4?t=1754628660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET ARINA &amp; FRENDT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years after their childhood adventures, Frendt stumbles upon Arina\u2019s old diary while packing up a home full of memories. As he opens its pages, a forgotten world awakens\u2014recollections come to life, and the story of their friendship begins again in Hidden Memories of The Gardens Between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/0cb90aa6312175cb61fb58f67126db87.poster.avif?t=1754628660\" width=450 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/0cb90aa6312175cb61fb58f67126db87.webm?t=1754628660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/0cb90aa6312175cb61fb58f67126db87.mp4?t=1754628660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a richly expanded version of <i>The Gardens Between</i>, reimagined for virtual reality. With twice the content of the original, <i>Hidden Memories</i> invites you to revisit familiar moments and uncover entirely new ones\u2014woven seamlessly into a deeper, more intimate journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT'S NEW IN HIDDEN MEMORIES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully remastered visual experience, crafted for virtual reality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arina\u2019s illustrated diary offers new insights and perspectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physically interactive puzzle elements unique to VR gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles handcrafted to echo the textures of memory\u2014intimate, surreal, and emotionally resonant</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/eb8188584dd5997546d7a7f5d080cfd8.poster.avif?t=1754628660\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/eb8188584dd5997546d7a7f5d080cfd8.webm?t=1754628660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/eb8188584dd5997546d7a7f5d080cfd8.mp4?t=1754628660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control time itself to solve puzzles built from the emotional architecture of memory. Move time with your hands as dreamlike islands revolve before you\u2014each one a sculpted memory, built from the emotions and objects that shaped Arina and Frendt\u2019s past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate time and objects in surreal, memory-filled environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your hands to interact with objects -\u00a0from childhood toys to symbolic tools of self-expression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover surreal landscapes where every detail carries emotional weight</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/ae39426d74cab3abdfd4a18f7bb2bbcf.poster.avif?t=1754628660\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/ae39426d74cab3abdfd4a18f7bb2bbcf.webm?t=1754628660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/ae39426d74cab3abdfd4a18f7bb2bbcf.mp4?t=1754628660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through Arina\u2019s evolving diary, experience the subtle, sometimes bittersweet shifts of a childhood bond growing older. Each island captures a turning point, a feeling, or a forgotten moment\u2014rendered in vivid color and texture.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NARRATIVE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the story through Arina's diary entries and artistic evolution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore themes of memory, growth, and the spaces between people</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Revisit moments that defined their friendship\u2014and changed them forever</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the past with new eyes, in a world made to be felt as much as seen</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/1903a442893eb113f64fac66e750c6e0.poster.avif?t=1754628660\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/1903a442893eb113f64fac66e750c6e0.webm?t=1754628660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/1903a442893eb113f64fac66e750c6e0.mp4?t=1754628660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/87086e7273e3655fa6fc35d90b82cbe5.poster.avif?t=1754628660\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/87086e7273e3655fa6fc35d90b82cbe5.webm?t=1754628660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/87086e7273e3655fa6fc35d90b82cbe5.mp4?t=1754628660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET ARINA &amp; FRENDT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years after their childhood adventures, Frendt stumbles upon Arina\u2019s old diary while packing up a home full of memories. As he opens its pages, a forgotten world awakens\u2014recollections come to life, and the story of their friendship begins again in Hidden Memories of The Gardens Between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/0cb90aa6312175cb61fb58f67126db87.poster.avif?t=1754628660\" width=450 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/0cb90aa6312175cb61fb58f67126db87.webm?t=1754628660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/0cb90aa6312175cb61fb58f67126db87.mp4?t=1754628660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a richly expanded version of <i>The Gardens Between</i>, reimagined for virtual reality. With twice the content of the original, <i>Hidden Memories</i> invites you to revisit familiar moments and uncover entirely new ones\u2014woven seamlessly 